Decision Engine JS

This project implements a portable ONNX runtime for Laya-compatible typed-decision models.

Laya models, architecture, and the original Python implementation are by Convai Innovations
and contributors:
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya

The model and original project are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Generated model artifacts are not included in this source repository.
